ss=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/about-us/venue-hire/\">Venue hire</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li id=\"menu-item-120\" class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-has-children\"><a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/support-us/\">Support us</a><div class=\"link-arrow\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12\" height=\"7.399\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 7.399\">\n          <path d=\"M6,12,0,6,6,0,7.4,1.4,2.8,6l4.6,4.6Z\"\n                transform=\"translate(0 7.399) rotate(-90)\"\n                fill=\"#1a1a1a\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n<ul class=\"sub-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-2188\" class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/support-us/our-supporters/\">Our supporters</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-2187\" class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page\"><a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/support-us/become-a-patron/\">Become a Patron</a></li>\n\t<li id=\"menu-item-2845\" class=\" menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom\"><a href=\"https://volunteer.museumofthehome.org.uk/\">Volunteer</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item--shop mb-only\"><a href=\"https://shop.museumofthehome.org.uk/\">Shop</a></li><li class=\"menu-item menu-item--donate mb-only\"><a href=\"/support-us\">Donate</a></li><li class=\"menu-item menu-item--search mb-only\"><a href=\"/search\">Search</a></li></ul></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </nav>\n\t\n\t<main id=\"primary\" class=\"site-main\">\n\n\t\t\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs \">\n\n      <div class=\"container\">\n    \n    <p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span><span><a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/\">Home</a></span> » <span class=\"breadcrumb_last\" aria-current=\"page\">What&#8217;s on</span></span></p>\n        </div>\n  \n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<header class=\"page--header page--header-title container\">\n\n\t\t\t<h1>What&#8217;s on</h1>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"article-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"whats-on--featured featured--items-listing\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"whats-on--featured__items listing--featured__items\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"card--base card--featured \">\n\n  <div class=\"card-image img-fit\">\n\n    <img width=\"1200\" height=\"630\" src=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/MotH_2025_Tour_Changing-Faces.png\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"A painting depicting ships sailing in a bay\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" srcset=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/MotH_2025_Tour_Changing-Faces.png 1200w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/MotH_2025_Tour_Changing-Faces-300x158.png 300w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/MotH_2025_Tour_Changing-Faces-1024x538.png 1024w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/MotH_2025_Tour_Changing-Faces-768x403.png 768w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/MotH_2025_Tour_Changing-Faces-724x380.png 724w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" />\n    \n      <div class=\"card-tags\">\n\n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-filter\">\n            Collections          </span>\n\n        \n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-type\">\n            Tours guided          </span>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n    \n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card-content d-flex flex-column\">\n\n    <h3 class=\"card-title\">\n      Changing Faces in a Changing City: Migration to London in the Age of Sail, 1600-1850    </h3>\n\n          <div class=\"card-summary\">\n        <p>This tour brings our galleries to life with stories of how and why early migrant communities came to live in London.</p>\n      </div>\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"card-meta d-flex flex-wrap jc-sb\">\n\n        \n          <p class=\"card-date fw-b\">\n            Every Friday          </p>\n\n        \n        \n          <p class=\"card-price fw-sb\">\n            Drop-in | Free with optional donation          </p>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/whats-on/changing-faces-in-a-changing-city-migration-to-london-in-the-age-of-sail-1600-1850/\" class=\"card-accessible-link\">\n    <span class=\"sr-text\">Changing Faces in a Changing City: Migration to London in the Age of Sail, 1600-1850</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"card--base card--featured \">\n\n  <div class=\"card-image img-fit\">\n\n    <img width=\"1360\" height=\"844\" src=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Museum-of-th-Home_Collection-Splats-and-Splindles-IMG_3915_Credit-Museum-of-the-Home-1360x844.jpg\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"A close up photograph of the splats and spindles of a wooden chair.\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Museum-of-th-Home_Collection-Splats-and-Splindles-IMG_3915_Credit-Museum-of-the-Home-1360x844.jpg 1360w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Museum-of-th-Home_Collection-Splats-and-Splindles-IMG_3915_Credit-Museum-of-the-Home-680x422.jpg 680w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\" />\n    \n      <div class=\"card-tags\">\n\n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-filter\">\n            Collections          </span>\n\n        \n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n    \n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card-content d-flex flex-column\">\n\n    <h3 class=\"card-title\">\n      Splats and Spindles: Six English Regional Chairs    </h3>\n\n          <div class=\"card-summary\">\n        <p>Get up close with six English regional chairs, learn the stories of both celebrated and lesser-known makers, and discover how everyday furniture can…</p>\n      </div>\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"card-meta d-flex flex-wrap jc-sb\">\n\n        \n          <p class=\"card-date fw-b\">\n            Ongoing          </p>\n\n        \n        \n          <p class=\"card-price fw-sb\">\n            Free          </p>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/whats-on/splats-and-spindles/\" class=\"card-accessible-link\">\n    <span class=\"sr-text\">Splats and Spindles: Six English Regional Chairs</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"card--base card--featured \">\n\n  <div class=\"card-image img-fit\">\n\n    <img width=\"1360\" height=\"844\" src=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/MotH_2024_Rooms-Through-Time-A-Townhouse-in-1878_Credit_Jaron-James_147-1-1360x844.jpg\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"A richly furnished Victorian townhouse room (c.1878) with mint green patterned wallpaper and red carpet, featuring a red upholstered armchair draped with embroidery beside a fireplace topped by twin ceramic vases, framed artwork, a carved wooden piano, a tea table, and in the left bottom corner is an ayah&#039;s trunk of Indian textiles.\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/MotH_2024_Rooms-Through-Time-A-Townhouse-in-1878_Credit_Jaron-James_147-1-1360x844.jpg 1360w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/MotH_2024_Rooms-Through-Time-A-Townhouse-in-1878_Credit_Jaron-James_147-1-680x422.jpg 680w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\" />\n    \n      <div class=\"card-tags\">\n\n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-filter\">\n            Collections          </span>\n\n        \n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n    \n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card-content d-flex flex-column\">\n\n    <h3 class=\"card-title\">\n      Rooms Through Time    </h3>\n\n          <div class=\"card-summary\">\n        <p>How home life has evolved over four centuries.</p>\n      </div>\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"card-meta d-flex flex-wrap jc-sb\">\n\n        \n          <p class=\"card-date fw-b\">\n            Permanent          </p>\n\n        \n        \n          <p class=\"card-price fw-sb\">\n            Free          </p>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/whats-on/rooms-through-time/\" class=\"card-accessible-link\">\n    <span class=\"sr-text\">Rooms Through Time</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"card--base card--featured \">\n\n  <div class=\"card-image img-fit\">\n\n    <img width=\"1360\" height=\"844\" src=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WrightWright_Museum-of-the-Home_Hoxton_Visit-2_╕HuftonCrow_009-1360x844.jpg\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"A view of gardens with trees.\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WrightWright_Museum-of-the-Home_Hoxton_Visit-2_╕HuftonCrow_009-1360x844.jpg 1360w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WrightWright_Museum-of-the-Home_Hoxton_Visit-2_╕HuftonCrow_009-680x422.jpg 680w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\" />\n    \n      <div class=\"card-tags\">\n\n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-filter\">\n            Gardens          </span>\n\n        \n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n    \n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card-content d-flex flex-column\">\n\n    <h3 class=\"card-title\">\n      Gardens Through Time    </h3>\n\n          <div class=\"card-summary\">\n        <p>Discover how city gardens have changed and developed over the centuries.</p>\n      </div>\n    \n    \n      <div class=\"card-meta d-flex flex-wrap jc-sb\">\n\n        \n          <p class=\"card-date fw-b\">\n             Open 10am-5pm during Museum opening hours          </p>\n\n        \n        \n          <p class=\"card-price fw-sb\">\n            Free          </p>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/whats-on/gardens-through-time/\" class=\"card-accessible-link\">\n    <span class=\"sr-text\">Gardens Through Time</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"card--base card--featured \">\n\n  <div class=\"card-image img-fit\">\n\n    <img width=\"1360\" height=\"844\" src=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image-71dafb93-7682-4b51-8b71-c70f98d03873-1360x844.jpg\" class=\"card-img\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image-71dafb93-7682-4b51-8b71-c70f98d03873-1360x844.jpg 1360w, https://museumofthehome.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image-71dafb93-7682-4b51-8b71-c70f98d03873-680x422.jpg 680w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\" />\n    \n      <div class=\"card-tags\">\n\n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-filter\">\n            Exhibitions          </span>\n\n        \n        \n          <span class=\"card-tag card-tag-type\">\n            Drop-in          </span>\n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n    \n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card-content d-flex flex-column\">\n\n    <h3 class=\"card-title\">\n      Echoing Whispers: Treasury of Vietnamese Folk Tales    </h3>\n\n          <div class=\"card-summary\">\n        <p>Major Books presents a series of Vietnamese lacquer-inspired paintings that shimmer with stories of heritage, magic and beli